  "_comment": [
    "Places visited. THIS IS THE ONLY FILE TO EDIT — add a row and run",
    "  node scripts/fetch-places.mjs",
    "which resolves each against Wikidata and pulls a freely-licensed photograph",
    "from Wikimedia Commons where one exists.",
    "",
    "`q` is the Wikidata search term and only differs from `name` when the name on",
    "its own is ambiguous. `qid` pins an item outright when the search still gets",
    "it wrong. `no_photo` skips the image lookup.",
    "",
    "`skiing` is the same shape and goes through the same script — a ski resort is",
    "a place with a photograph. It renders as its own section.",
    "",
    "`file` pins a Commons filename outright, for items with no P18.",
    "`latlon` pins coordinates by hand for the one item whose Wikidata entry has no P625.",
    "`no_lookup` skips Wikidata entirely, for a business with no item — a wrong coordinate is worse than none."
  ],
